---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Spickle Cleaning & Sealing"
  description="How Spickle handles the personal information you give us when you ask for a quote or contact us."
>
  <section class="band hairline-top">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>This page covers what information Spickle Pty Ltd collects through this website and what we do with it.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you ask for a quote or contact us, we collect what you give us: your name, phone number, email address, the job address, and any photos or details of the work. Quote requests made through this site are handled in ServiceM8, the job management system we run the business on.</p>

      <h2>What we use it for</h2>
      <p>Quoting, booking and doing your job, and contacting you about it. If you've asked for a quote, we may follow up about that quote. We don't sell or rent your details to anyone.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This site doesn't run advertising cookies. <span class="todo-inline">[Confirm analytics setup at launch: if analytics are added, name the tool here.]</span></p>

      <h2>Questions or corrections</h2>
      <p>To ask what we hold about you, correct it, or have it deleted, email <a class="tlink" href="mailto:info@spickle.com.au">info@spickle.com.au</a> or call <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">1300 22 00 45</a>.</p>

      <div class="todo">[For Lukey to review before launch. Replaces the old Strikingly cookie boilerplate, which described ecommerce and live chat features the site doesn't have.]</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); margin-top: 1.8em; }
  .todo { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
